title: Kitchen3B
---
// Talk target of the kitchenette in 3B (Hotspots layer). See window_3b.yarn.
-> Look
    <<if $chapter == "R1Viewing" and $gate_r1_view_knock and not $gate_r1_view_kitchen>>
        <<set $gate_r1_view_kitchen to true>>
        <<face Samantha Player>>
        // PLACEHOLDER lines.
        <<if $r1_viewing_why == "">>
            <<set $r1_viewing_why to "kitchen">>
            {$samantha_name}: The kitchen first. Either you cook, or you want me to think you do.
        <<endif>>
        {$samantha_name}: Two rings and a fridge that hums. You're looking at the sockets like they might bite.
        {$samantha_name}: How old are you, anyway?
        You: Old enough to sign a lease.
        {$samantha_name}: Barely, by the look of you. I'm twenty-five, I've signed four.
        <<if $gate_r1_view_window and $gate_r1_view_kitchen and $gate_r1_view_bath>>
            <<note r1_view "Tell Samantha you've seen enough.">>
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif $chapter == "R1Viewing">>
        You: Two rings and a fridge that hums.
    <<else>>
        You: Two rings and a fridge that hums. I've used one of the rings.
    <<endif>>
===
